{"id":"22.01.Playgendary","contentHtml":"<p>My journey at Playgendary is a case of <strong>rapid professional growth</strong>: in 10 months, I went from a Unity Developer to a position involving the <strong>role of <code>Technical Owner</code></strong> on the company's flagship projects and <strong>architecting new games from scratch</strong>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Key Responsibilities &#x26; Achievements</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Leadership on the flagship <em>Home Design</em> project:</strong> Took technical ownership of the project, conducted deep architectural analysis, and established processes within a new team.</li>\n<li><strong>Bootstrapping New Projects:</strong> Launched game development from scratch (Greenfield) in tandem with PMs, laying down scalable architecture and supervising projects during MVP stages.</li>\n<li><strong>R&#x26;D and Prototyping:</strong> <mark>Proactively researched and implemented complex mechanics</mark> to improve product quality.</li>\n<li><strong>Rendering &#x26; Tech Art:</strong> Beyond gameplay, I was responsible for writing and optimizing <strong>shaders (HLSL)</strong> and visual effects.</li>\n<li><strong>Mentorship &#x26; Code Review:</strong> Helped the team grow by implementing code quality standards, specifically in memory and CPU optimization.</li>\n<li><strong>Work under NDA:</strong> <mark>Most projects I worked on are under strict NDA.</mark></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>The Key Challenge</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>The main challenge</strong> was relaunching development on the Home Design hit. The project required rapid immersion into a <strong>complex Enterprise architecture</strong> and the independent restoration of full technical context. <strong>I conducted</strong> a deep reverse engineering of the codebase, <strong>formed a team</strong>, and established a predictable feature delivery pipeline.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Legacy &#x26; Growth</h2>\n<p>Playgendary became the driver of my transition to an <strong>Architect and <code>Technical Owner</code> role</strong>. I learned to take full responsibility for the tech stack and the team. This experience proved that my <strong>engineering strategy directly impacts business metrics</strong> — from stability (Crash Free) to successful monetization implementation.</p>\n","published":true,"title":"Playgendary","date":"2022-01 - 2023-03","type":"experience","tagsArray":["Mobile","Unity","C#","HLSL","Addressables","DOTween","Firebase (Analytics, Crashlytics, Config, Messaging)","VFX","UniTask","Odin Inspector"],"heroVideo":null,"shortDescription":"<p>My path at Playgendary: in 10 months, I grew from a developer to a specialist entrusted with the <strong>role of Technical Owner</strong> on flagship hits and launching new projects.</p>\n","storeLinks":["https://www.playgendary.com","https://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=4614678246860437532","https://apps.apple.com/iq/developer/playgendary-limited/id1487320337"],"role":"unity-dev","projectIcon":"/images/projects/22.01.Playgendary/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/22.01.Playgendary/card.webp","screenshots":[]}